  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center of Concern</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The work of the Center of Concern during the past several years has been directed at analyses of globalisation through the lens of gender, class and race, with a concern for human rights, especially economic and social rights.
In its recent analysis of the evolving situation during a staff planning retreat, the Center of Concern identified its work for the next year as threefold: 1) Continuing to work to discredit the current neo-liberal economic and social model; 2) Seeking alternatives that translate into policy redirection; and 3) working for and within global solidarity.  These goals will be addressed through several coordinated project activities.</narrative>
  </description>
